      "zh": "一個營地，一個開始",
      "en": "One camp, a beginning"
    },
    "body": {
      "zh": "1907 年，貝登堡帶領 20 名不同背景的少年在白浪島舉行實驗營，成為童軍運動的起點。WOSM 現行資料記載 20 人；部分舊資料則記載 22 人。",
      "en": "Baden-Powell brought 20 boys to an experimental camp on Brownsea Island in 1907. WOSM now says 20; some older accounts say 22."
    },
    "sources": [
      "wosm-history",
      "wosm-2007"
    ],
